<h1>My real name is Nikita.<br/> And the last name is Nova.</h1>
<h1>I am a designer with experience as a manager, editor, programmer, screenwriter and art director</h1>
<h1>I live this life through curiosity, the drive to explore new things and honesty</h1>
<i>I have been working as a designer since 2019</i>
<div class="ids__space L"></div>
<p>What I can do:</p>
<ul>
<li>Design a brand identity and carry out rebranding</li>
<li>Edit videos, animate graphics, do motion design</li>
<li>Draw fonts and lettering</li>
<li>Draw illustrations </li>
<li>Vibecode scripts to optimize tasks</li>
<li>Layout websites using html + css</li>
<li>Write text from headlines to hour-long scripts</li>
<li>Working with 3D in Blender</li>
<li>Process photos</li>
<li>Prepare layouts using printing, embroidery and other production methods</li>
<li>Work with neural networks for illustrations, video text, 3D, animation</li>
<li>Train AI models to create new styles</li>
<li>Code scripts, websites and applications</li>
</ul>
<p>This is the kind of person I am ¯\_(ツ)_/¯</p>
